OL,3,GNEWSAFirst closure order issued over
OL,4,Aillegal vape sales
OL,5,
OL,6,FA shop has been ordered to close after
OL,7,Fit was found to be selling illegal
OL,8,Ftobacco, cigarettes and vapes.
OL,10,FOrange Shop on Hainton Avenue in
OL,11,FGrimsby has been issued with a closure
OL,12,Forder - the first of its kind in North
OL,13,FEast Lincolnshire.
OL,15,FThousands of items were found during a
OL,16,Fraid by officers from Humberside Police
OL,17,Fand North East Lincolnshire Council,
OL,18,Fincluding cigarettes and tobacco
OL,19,Fpouches with incorrect packaging, and
OL,20,Fvapes breaching legal limits.
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
